  "problems": "The official guide is a single image (store-assets-static-2024-w24-update1-smart-widget-contentpage-on-sizeguide-en.jpg) on only.com/<locale>/content/size-guides/size-guide; values were transcribed visually from the full-resolution image, so a second check is advisable. The product-page 'Size guide' button failed on en-gb (its /en-gb/sizeguide endpoint 404s) and sizeguide.only.com was 'Server Unavailable'. There is no separate jeans waist/hip table: jeans sizes appear only as a column (27-28, 30-31, 32-33, 34-35 share a row), so a denim-size lookup must go through this general chart. The XXXL row has no EU/UK/US/jeans size; its label is XXXL. A search snippet quoted a different ONLY jeans table (waist 59.5..84.5, hip 86.5..111.5 for 24..34) from an unidentified, possibly older source; it could not be found on the brand site and was not used. Letter values like 'L-XL' are copied as printed."
